SUMMARY:Foundy Fest Launch Party & Jam presented by Leona Wild Collective
DESCRIPTION:Asheville! Wednesday July 29th\, bring your guitars and banjos to @wheelhouseasheville for a good time. Get to know the team behind @foundy.fest and more about @leonawildcollective mission to make the music industry a more equitable place. \nWe’ll be enjoying coffee\, booze\, country\, + blues 6pm-9pm\n225 Coxe Ave
